  "body": "Found in the second read of PR #3462 (head 6ad6311fa). Work this issue after that PR merges.\n\n1. A Trace that meets protected items is refused, and the refusal names only the first item (`crates/app/src/operation/avoid.rs:261`, `.first()`). Issue #3348 asks for the list of the items. Name each item that the tool meets.\n2. The tilted pin (`crates/app/tests/do_not_touch/trace.rs:85-107`) checks a refusal only. No test has a tilted Trace that is clear of a protected item and generates. A frame fault would then give a false refusal that no test finds (never a gouge). Add the clear case.\n3. The approach from the tool change position is made in the post, not in the path. The protection check does not see it. This is the same for each operation kind with \"Do not touch\". Record if the post checks it, or file the defect.\n",
